  "abstract": "Analyzes 175 galaxies from the SPARC database using an ultra-phenomenological EFC-fit and a simplified \u039bCDM-NFW baseline to test the Energy-Flow Cosmology Regime (EFC-R) framework. Finds a strongly significant regime-dependent validity: EFC-fit succeeds in low-complexity FLOW systems (35%) and systematically fails in high-complexity LATENT systems (15%), with reproducible methods and full data/code release.",
